# lmdeck XTreme mode (docs/XTREME.md): stop/start the display manager, blank the panel, open the wall on its console,
# and for away mode Tailscale, the charge limit and the hardware watchdog; nothing else.
%USER% ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/libexec/lmdeck-xtreme-root ^(desktop-stop|desktop-start|screen-off|screen-on|wall|remote-on|remote-off|battery-limit (80|100)|watchdog-on|watchdog-off)$
